라, <strong>지방 소재 청년 본인에게도 2년간 720만 원의 추가 인센티브</strong>를 직접 제공합니다. 이는 사내 연봉 밴드를 흔드는 리스크 없이, 핵심 인재의 실질 소득을 <strong>연간 360만 원 인상</strong>시키는 강력한 채용 브랜딩 무기입니다. 비수도권 계열사 리더분들은 이를 공고 단계부터 핵심 셀링 포인트로 적극 노출하셔야 합니다.</p><h3 style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#00A7A7;margin:24px 0 10px;letter-spacing:-0.2px;line-height:1.5;\"><strong>3. 조직 문화의 AX: 업무분담과 유연근무의 데이터화</strong></h3><div style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px;\"><img src=\"https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/2ac4a110-e746-41bd-9c31-c18b9fa9268e/06c4d271-625e-4b08-bbae-eec6b01b405d/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466QQSPU5CU%2F20260414%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260414T023351Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjELr%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJHMEUCIQDHwfvfx9At5rpyvvIQsK2D7gYME19nsAQxts1UfzkP7QIgfTqc3DLAsO5EqQ9UShzTit1%2B6ySc2kv2S3socQmFmI8qiAQIg%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARAAGgw2Mzc0MjMxODM4MDUiDMo4uY%2BYixUfd4iutCrcA5SHCzjvIgci3gkIu0KMTy72Rtpdr5JtEVFakXveSKweSa%2FKHvSt1TOFzX0IXMFnE7%2By8QQikrA6I%2FYqHeBztWBG0VXmwBJL7zhIEj4JiPtbpApgjx62Uv%2F6DgCF7UyikYO2JAsRozdR5CkdPpDgsX8ibhxVFoxrF0pYrifbB4CzAHqmnLRIlC0cSrCziOJA8YgerP70VDuB88M86HXZccq8dVplzKJV%2FIb8X8fGgkURQ6w1ofA5GCqKuBsbMm9p3nEM%2Btwc7s4bUSrUgTvAgYiakb8QdWzntpRmAGkOAHZ4hZ7MLlOYvohRRMfnseHhvFHiLQRx8WRgrdSsxXWAvvo4A32X6wyn8iwxedgPch717DRW3ViLuNqCTBgJlU4CFtWKrq2lSvQkWhLfRh63BGTxAGV%2FblWrhiInT1DsmnjB%2FkMKLKnmtIY1YYUjtxmX5K8bj3gfv5bfphkAK0xVHOjXyQ5eDU3KeYgSf3RKENcdovnBtFHhVDXn9P32CveE9Bbu9NM2%2FKIP38faigxp26pFdELno5gyKHQ2QX4hI2xujoHHHYTvpev6%2FpT13U6lsVhkd%2BjkIY6q5zAYSIZipU6yRvkiShP%2BQ5vI18mFpSsG1spKJgrexLJvlY4AMOrF9s4GOqUBNRw29mL%2FFChxhDmgeFD1bGqAqW7b354kEbaId1ZFe0PnCy43Hry6PS4%2Fxfz7Kbsp5hXvOOT8hXaGXyg%2FbDT7KuM%2FY0Y%2FhRi9%2BbUkWQ%2F3Cvo%2BIqnyOeJ9TVOw0gr7ueR3RspjRpR5UdE4MQJxq3D3I1ZMAoLqU2pFU9mX5I4P2claE5pS0%2BWs2fX2NMs3EjNzrbCvWjn3CvlroFnPNQUsi7T1yA8h&X-Amz-Signature=79faa786fe42523a24f52b3fe4